# Industrial 24V DC Control Architecture & PLC I/O Mapping

### System Power Distribution
* **Main Incomer:** 230V AC Single Phase, 50 Hz.
* **Control Power Supply (SMPS):** 24V DC, 10A regulated industrial DIN-rail power supply (Phoenix Contact / Mean Well).
* **Controller Core:** Siemens SIMATIC S7-1200 (CPU 1214C DC/DC/DC, 14 DI / 10 DO / 2 AI).
* **Operating Pneumatic Supply:** 6.0 bar regulated dry compressed air via Janatics FRL unit.

---

### Digital Input (DI) Pin Assignment (`%I0.0 - %I1.1`)

All field sensors are 24V DC, 3-wire PNP, Normally Open (NO) devices sinking into the PLC optical isolators.

| Terminal | Tag Name | Hardware Sensor / Device | Signal Type | Functionality |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `%I0.0` | `DI_EmergencyStop` | Mushroom E-Stop Button (NC) | 24V DC (Fail-Safe) | Cuts master safety relay control circuit |
| `%I0.1` | `DI_StartPB` | Green Momentary Push Button | 24V DC (NO) | Starts conveyor indexing sequence |
| `%I0.2` | `DI_StopPB` | Red Momentary Push Button (NC) | 24V DC | Controlled system stop / line flush |
| `%I0.3` | `DI_PartDetectTrigger` | Photoelectric Thru-Beam Sensor | 24V DC PNP (NO) | Ingress trigger registering workpiece arrival |
| `%I0.4` | `DI_InductiveSensor` | Inductive Proximity (M18, Sn=8mm) | 24V DC PNP (NO) | Ferrous / non-ferrous metallic detection |
| `%I0.5` | `DI_CapacitiveSensor` | Capacitive Proximity (M18, Sn=12mm)| 24V DC PNP (NO) | High-dielectric / moisture / organic detection |
| `%I0.6` | `DI_Cyl1_Retracted` | Janatics Reed Switch (Cylinder 1) | 24V DC (NO) | Metallic ejector home position feedback |
| `%I0.7` | `DI_Cyl1_Extended` | Janatics Reed Switch (Cylinder 1) | 24V DC (NO) | Metallic ejector stroke complete feedback |
| `%I1.0` | `DI_Cyl2_Retracted` | Janatics Reed Switch (Cylinder 2) | 24V DC (NO) | Plastic/Dry ejector home position feedback |
| `%I1.1` | `DI_PressureSwitch` | Janatics Digital Pressure Switch | 24V DC (NO) | Air pressure interlock ($\ge 5.5\text{ bar}$) |

