### Digital Output (DO) Pin Assignment (`%Q0.0 - %Q0.7`)

All outputs trigger 24V DC solenoid coils and contactors via intermediate optocoupled relay modules.

| Terminal | Tag Name | Actuator / Controlled Device | Electrical Rating | Functionality |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `%Q0.0` | `DO_ConveyorMotor` | 24V DC Geared Motor Drive / Contactor | 24V DC, 2.5A | Line conveyor continuous traverse drive |
| `%Q0.1` | `DO_Solenoid_Cyl1` | Janatics 5/2 Solenoid Valve (Station 1) | 24V DC, 4.2W | Ejection impulse for Metallic Waste |
| `%Q0.2` | `DO_Solenoid_Cyl2` | Janatics 5/2 Solenoid Valve (Station 2) | 24V DC, 4.2W | Ejection impulse for Dry/Plastic Waste |
| `%Q0.3` | `DO_TowerLamp_Green`| LED Stack Light (Green) | 24V DC, 0.1A | System healthy and conveyor running |
| `%Q0.4` | `DO_TowerLamp_Yellow`| LED Stack Light (Amber) | 24V DC, 0.1A | Standby / Line paused / Inspection active |
| `%Q0.5` | `DO_TowerLamp_Red` | LED Stack Light (Red Steady) | 24V DC, 0.1A | E-Stop asserted or low pressure fault |
| `%Q0.6` | `DO_HooterBuzzer` | Warning Piezo Siren | 24V DC, 0.2A | E-Stop, jam, or pneumatic loss alarm |

